{"id":"908bea5b0f15b61b","group":"92","path":"92/92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness.md","title":"True Sigma1 Sentences in the Book’s Weak Systems","display":"cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness — True Sigma1 Sentences in the Book’s Weak Systems","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness","aliases":["92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness"],"display":"cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness — True Sigma1 Sentences in the Book’s Weak Systems","source":"第 V 章 pp. 56–58、71，Σ1 完备性与 Theorem B+（PDF 73–75、88）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness]]","[[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness — True Sigma1 Sentences in the Book’s Weak Systems"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 56–58、71，Σ1 完备性与 Theorem B+（PDF 73–75、88）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf0f2611d5bc4db4\" href=\"?note=cf0f2611d5bc4db4\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness\">92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd6b982556489ede\" href=\"?note=bd6b982556489ede\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution\">92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathcal S_E^0\">\\(H\\in\\mathcal S_E^0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_E(H)\\subseteq\\{v_i^E\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_E(H)\\subseteq\\{v_i^E\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\exists_E v_i^E H\">\\(F=\\exists_E v_i^E H\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\{R_{0,A},R_A,Q_{0,A},Q_A,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\">\\(U\\in\\{R_{0,A},R_A,Q_{0,A},Q_A,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\\)</span>；标准真值、闭数码代入与有限证明采用前述原书节点。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}weak\\text{-}sigma1\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{True}_E(F)\\Longrightarrow U\\vdash F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}weak\\text{-}sigma1\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{True}_E(F)\\Longrightarrow U\\vdash F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>真存在句有一个标准自然数见证 n。其闭实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(H)\">\\(\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(H)\\)</span> 是真的 Σ₀ 句，前一定理给出 U 的证明；等式一阶逻辑的存在引入再给出 F 的证明。此处不要求系统正确性来构造该证明。</p>\n<p>结论只有“真 Σ₁ 句可证”。相容性本身不允许把假 Σ₁ 句全都反驳，更不允许推导标准模型真值与可证性等价。原书对 1-相容性、ω-相容性另有额外条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"cf0f2611d5bc4db4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"bd6b982556489ede","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H\\in\\mathcal S_E^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_E(H)\\subseteq\\{v_i^E\\}","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\exists_E v_i^E H","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\{R_{0,A},R_A,Q_{0,A},Q_A,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}weak\\text{-}sigma1\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{True}_E(F)\\Longrightarrow U\\vdash F.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(H)","display":false}],"bytes":1485,"backlinks":[{"id":"6fc24b4011f16912","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本文明定 1-Con 为 Σ₁ 可靠性。原书相应论证主要使用 ω-相容性及 Σ₀ 正确判定，并没有在这些页把本地这个谓词作为统一定义。对原书无指数弱系统，真实 Σ₁ 可证见 [[92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness]]；这与“所有已证 Σ₁ 都真”方向相反。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书弱系统：[[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]] → [[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness]] → [[92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness]]。[[92-thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence]]完成练习8，说明比较模式 Ω₅ 的实际用途。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-361","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["cf0f2611d5bc4db4","bd6b982556489ede"]}